       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That's double the maximum recommended metformin dose of 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release in adults. A dose that high raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nWas one of these intended?\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals.** This is 2,550 mg/day, the max dose.\n- **1700 mg/day in total.** For example, 850 mg PO twice daily with meals.\n- **Another dose.** Many patients are started lower, such as 500 mg once or twice daily, and titrated up.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1700 mg three times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
